meta {
  name: Sim run script points
  type: http
  seq: 31
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sim/runs/:id/points
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  id: sim-1
}

docs {
  sim-1 is a placeholder on purpose: run ids exist only while the run is in
  memory. Copy a real id from GET /sim/runs (start one with POST /sim/runs),
  and note a run is pruned 10 minutes after it ends and a backend restart
  empties the whole rig.

  That is why the session-keyed route exists — use
  sim/run-route-by-session.bru to inspect a FINISHED race.
}
